# Dispatch failure: instance exists for String but call site passes
# Integer — no type guard matches, so "no instance found" error fires.
# The String instance causes Phase 1b to inject an EffectPerform address
# for 'whoops', but at runtime the Integer argument matches no candidate.
[
  NoMatch: [class [let a]
    whoops: []]
  [instance NoMatch
    [let a@String]: [whoops: [fn [let x] "string"]]]
  result: [whoops 42]
]
=== error
no instance found for typeclass method 'whoops'
